// Title: User Added To Root/Sudoers Group Using Usermod
// Rule ID: 6a50f16c-3b7b-42d1-b081-0fdd3ba70a73
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.persistence
// Category: process_creation
